{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561600/extras/43cbb2f76956b3fe8b9aa101f494d07e.avif?t=1751477586\" data-has-big width=800 height=313 /></span>Built on top of Lambda Fortress, <strong>Fortress Connected </strong>is a mash-up mod for Team Fortress 2. Fight through various source engine worlds as the Team Fortress 2 cast along with new and old faces! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to play through <i>Half-Life 2</i>\u00a0and its\u00a0episodes, <i>Left 4 Dead 1</i>,\u00a0and more as the TF2 cast alone or with friends! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old and new custom classes based on new designs or familiar faces from other mods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom coop campaign experiences with updating support for more in the future!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special features like Grenades, Armour, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons, buildables, and achievements!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New types of enemies and allies you can find in your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support for custom mods and maps!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Half-Life 2: Deathmatch support with a TDM gamemode!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for your entire TF2 inventory!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more to come in the future!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a fan of co-op? That's fine too!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortress Connected</strong> also supports all the gamemodes that live TF2 does. Experience the regular modes with new classes and items. <br>  <br><i>Content warning: </i>    <br><i>This game contains the same level of violence as 